Hecks.hecksagon "Plan" do
  # DDD replication : a Story reads its OWN sprint_active flag (the pending_task_count
  # pattern). These driven adapters maintain it from Sprint lifecycle events, fanning
  # out over the aggregate-LOCAL Story.BySprint query. No aggregate reads a sibling
  # synchronously — Sprint emits, the Story flag follows. {id} is the activated/closed
  # sprint number ; {ref} is each matched Story.

end
